+  across real benchmark runs against real sites. One narrow, honestly-stated exception: a
+  retained Chrome launch flag (`--disable-blink-features=AutomationControlled`) hides
+  `navigator.webdriver` from simple client-side detection scripts — measured directly — but that
+  alone does not defeat Cloudflare, CAPTCHA, or any real bot-detection service, which use far
